    <textTemplates>
        <description>The body of the email if the case is for an Account that moved from AGP to Premier</description>
        <name>TextTemplate_EmailBody_AGPtoPremier</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Hello {!$Record.Contact.FirstName},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;I am pleased to inform you that your account is transitioning to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;AGP Premier&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;, our highest partnership tier for top agencies investing $10,000 or more per month. This transition ensures that you will retain your current AGP benefits while unlocking exclusive advantages designed to facilitate more rapid and efficient scaling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The new benefits include the following:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Monthly loyalty credits, with up to 17.5% of your expenditure credited back to your account&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;A dedicated Business Consultant specializing in large-scale agencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Early access to new products and features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Custom LMS integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;A direct line to provide input regarding EverQuote&apos;s product roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;As part of this transition, you will be working with {!$Record.Account.Support_Rep__r.FirstName} {!$Record.Account.Support_Rep__r.LastName} (copied here) as your dedicated Business Consultant moving forward. They will serve as your primary point of contact for strategic guidance and support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;It has been an absolute pleasure working with you over the past several months. Please do not hesitate to reach out should you have any questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Best,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!$Record.Owner:User.FirstName} {!$Record.Owner:User.LastName}&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <description>Body of email sent if Subject is contains Premier to AGP</description>
        <name>TextTemplate_EmailBody_PremierToAGP</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Hello {!$Record.Contact.FirstName},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;I am writing to provide an update regarding the status of your account. Due to your monthly investment falling below the required $10,000 minimum for the AGP Premier tier, your account is being transitioned to our standard AGP tier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Please be assured that the core components of your account will remain unchanged, including your lead discounts, monthly loyalty credits, and dedicated support. The primary modification is a change in your designated Business Consultant, as you will transition from a senior team member to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Account.Support_Rep__r.FirstName} &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Account.Support_Rep__r.LastName}. Additionally, please note that access to analytics support, custom LMS integrations, and annual EverQuoteAgent events will no longer be available under this tier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Should your investment increase in the future, we would be pleased to reinstate your account to the Premier tier once the $10,000 monthly minimum is consistently maintained. You may discuss this opportunity with {!$Record.Account.Support_Rep__r.FirstName} or contact me directly to review the requirements for returning to AGP Premier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Account.Support_Rep__r.FirstName} &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;will serve as your primary point of contact moving forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Best,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Owner:User.FirstName} {!$Record.Owner:User.LastName}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
