t;a href=&quot;mailto:support@everquote.com&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;support@everquote.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt; can help! We appreciate your business and look forward to continuing our partnership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The EverQuote Customer Success Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
